id: deeper-enhanced
name: Deeper Enhancement
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 2
# Not a Combat Condition: Deeper Enhancement's part of Magically Enhanced, a stack for each additional Action spent, on
# the same clock.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Wound and Soak Value 1(T) higher for each stack, while Magically Enhanced.
text: >
  Deeper Enhancement: "For each additional Action spent, increase that Ally's Wound and Soak Value by an additional 1(T)
  through the effects of Magical Enhancement."

---

[passive per stack]
wound += 1(T);
soakValue += 1(T);
